      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLY BURRA (7) was responsible for a very good effort last time over 1850m at this track, finishing third and just 1.2 metres from the winner. Drawn to enjoy a cosy run but might need things to go his way at some stage. Leading hope in a similar line-up. BRITTS MATE NZ (8) finished sixth two starts back at this track then gave nothing else a chance last start to win by 22 metres over 1780m at Redcliffe. No favours expected from this draw. Meets a comparable field so she can keep the ball rolling. STUDLEIGH ANNE (5) is worth another chance after a last-start ninth over 2040m at Redcliffe six days ago. DENIS THE PUNTER (2) is next best and gets every chance from a favourable draw.",
